# One-shot operator scripts (e.g. plan 02-14 migration runner). Underscore
# prefix marks them as ephemeral; they MUST NOT be committed because they
# can carry env-loading or paths specific to a single operator/session.
scripts/_*.mjs
scripts/_*.ts

